# warden — 16x16, seen from above.
#
# Broader and squarer than the player, and cold where the player is warm, so the two never read as
# the same kind of thing even at a glance. The two pale pixels are its eyes; they are the only high
# contrast on it, which is what makes a warden's facing legible without an animation system.
! . = 00000000   transparent
! k = 101422ff   outline
! d = 1f4a52ff   plate shadow
! t = 2e7d8aff   plate, the warden's teal
! e = a8e6d8ff   eyes
